<title>USA: Xerox, Ceridian announce 5-year agreement.</title>
<headline>Xerox, Ceridian announce 5-year agreement.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp said it reached a five-year agreement, valued at more than $40 million, to supply Ceridian Employer Services with high-speed laser printing systems for producing payroll checks, payroll-related reports and W-2 forms for Ceridian customers.</p>
<p>The contract, jointly announced by both companies, includes equipment, service, financing and supplies. It names Xerox as the sole print vendor, installing up to 69 Xerox DocuPrint 4635MX laser printing systems in 29 Ceridian district offices.</p>
</text>
